WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:09.440
Prayer and fasting, day five. Jesus is at one point in prayer. He is having a very hard time

2
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.360
He is struggling so much because he realizes that it is his last day before he

3
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:22.280
will be crucified. The well-known prayer is indeed the prayer from the garden of Gethsemane. Jesus

4
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:28.040
is physically struggling so much, he is so weak that the Bible even shows that he, due to his weakness

5
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:35.960
is having physical difficulties that he even sweats blood. He is having such a hard time at this moment. Jesus prays

6
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:42.920
at one point saying, Father this is so heavy. If there is any possibility that this

7
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:48.760
burden passes from me, please let it be possible. But here is the key that I

8
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:55.240
want to show you. Not my will, but your will be done. When I think about the concept of prayer

9
00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:01.360
and fasting, many Christians think it is a time when you can present a prayer to the Lord

10
00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:07.040
And because you are fasting, that you are in a kind of hunger strike, that

11
00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:14.360
you can move the heart of God and that you can make God do something based on your

12
00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:20.320
prayer. And although this sounds very good, this is actually not the way you should fast.

13
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:28.360
Fasting is not about presenting my will to God, but about God's will being presented to me.

14
00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:35.280
Not my will, but your will be done. So when you fast, you empty yourself to such an extent

15
00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:39.760
that you say it is not about my will, it is not about my desires, it is not about my

16
00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:45.360
needs, it is also not about my prayer, but it is about wanting to know what

17
00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:51.000
God's will for my life is. Why? Because it is much better to pray for what God's will is,

18
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:58.000
than to pray for what your will is. God's will is that you are happy, God's will is that

19
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.800
his church moves forward, God's will is that all situations where you would like a solution

20
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:11.320
for, God's will is always perfect in that. So as Christians, we must have a faith

21
00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:18.960
that my will may not be done, but that God's will may be done. Therefore you see that Jesus often

22
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:25.000
prays I do not do my own thing, but I do what I see the Father doing. I do not go after what I

23
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.960
want, but I let myself be led by the Holy Spirit. Jesus allowed himself to be baptized and the

24
00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.560
moment he comes out of the baptismal water, the Holy Spirit leads him into the wilderness. And so I want to

25
00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:42.600
also be a Christian who always lets myself be led by God bringing me on the right path,

26
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:50.920
by God guiding me and also by God guiding my prayers. During this season of Lent, I am

27
00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:57.960
therefore busy emptying myself and sometimes I even feel weak physically and

28
00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:04.080
actually my body does not want this. So actually I sometimes think to myself I do not want this,

29
00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.480
I have other needs, but then I tell myself but not my will is important,

30
00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:15.480
the will of the Father is important. This week I am praying for the future

31
00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:21.360
of Open Church. This week I am praying for the conflict in Israel. This week I am

32
00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:27.640
praying for my family situation, that we all may continue with God and that

33
00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:32.480
my children may be blessed in the kingdom of God and that they may come to know God. This

34
00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:37.360
week I am praying that I may draw closer to the Father and that I may love him more,

35
00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:44.640
for I realize that my love for the Father comes from the Father in me. But every time when I

36
00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:49.680
am praying for these situations and these various prayer points, I must

37
00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:56.080
realize that I am not presenting my wish list to God, but I want to pray this week,

38
00:03:56.080 --> 00:04:03.080
you must tell me what your will is. Not my will, but your will be done. Amen.
